Package: ldapred
Title: Predictive Linear Discriminant Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("ldapred team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ldapred.team@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Predictive linear discriminant analysis for a categorical target
    with two or more classes, with an R6 interface in the style of
    scikit-learn. Handles numeric and categorical predictors, gives the
    classification functions, a global evaluation of the model (confusion
    matrix, Wilks' lambda with Rao's F test) and the relevance of each
    variable, and offers stepwise variable selection (forward, backward,
    stepwise) and a high-dimensional LDA with shrinkage. Includes an
    interactive Shiny application.
URL: https://github.com/Abrlh/Analyse-Discriminante-Predictive-packageR
BugReports: https://github.com/Abrlh/Analyse-Discriminante-Predictive-packageR/issues
